OL,3,GNEWSA'I spent more than two days
OL,4,Awaiting in A&E' - NHS bids to end
OL,5,Acorridor care
OL,6,
OL,7,FA patient spent more than two days
OL,8,Fwaiting in A&E on two separate
OL,9,Foccasions - and has vowed never to go
OL,10,Fback.
OL,12,FAndrew Railton, 63, from Rhondda Cynon
OL,13,FTaf, said he sat "on the same chair" at
OL,14,FRoyal Glamorgan Hospital, in Talbot
OL,15,FGreen, for more than 50 hours on each
OL,16,Fvisit after suffering from pneumonia,
OL,17,Fand then "deathly low" potassium
OL,18,Flevels.
OL,20,FIt comes as a #23m plan by the Welsh
OL,21,Fgovernment promises to end A&E corridor
OL,22,Fcare in Wales by 2029.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,438,430,260,140,0,100
